1
00:00:00,850 --> 00:00:05,730
Copying a person's finger motion can fail when robot contacts behave differently.
机器人接触不同，照抄人手运动也可能失败。

2
00:00:06,130 --> 00:00:11,070
TeleDexter tracks both hand targets and the object's desired movement during teleoperation.
TeleDexter在遥操中同时跟踪手和物体目标。

3
00:00:11,530 --> 00:00:15,655
A learned controller decides how to maintain useful contact while following them.
学习控制器决定如何边跟踪边保持有效接触。

4
00:00:16,105 --> 00:00:22,805
Motion capture provides hand-object trajectories, but raw references may contain incompatible geometry.
动捕提供手物轨迹，原始参考可能几何不相容。

5
00:00:23,285 --> 00:00:30,325
Reference optimization adjusts contact, penetration, self-collision, and temporal smoothness before policy training.
参考优化先修正接触、穿透、自碰撞与平滑性。

6
00:00:30,725 --> 00:00:34,225
The output is a sequence of fingertip and object-pose subgoals.
输出是一串指尖与物体位姿子目标。

7
00:00:34,741 --> 00:00:41,381
A simulation-trained controller learns contact transitions rather than rigidly copying every reference frame.
仿真控制器学习接触切换，而非逐帧僵硬照搬。

8
00:00:42,001 --> 00:00:46,201
Randomization and action masking help transfer that behavior to the physical hand.
随机化和动作遮蔽帮助迁移到真实手。

9
00:00:46,581 --> 00:00:50,801
This adds dynamics-aware control beyond a purely geometric fingertip mapping.
这在纯几何指尖映射之外加入动力学控制。

10
00:00:51,424 --> 00:00:56,424
The real system uses NOKOV tracking for human motion and marked object poses.
真机用NOKOV追踪人手与带标记物体姿态。

11
00:00:56,864 --> 00:01:01,644
The operator switches from geometric pre-grasp mapping to the learned contact controller.
操作者从预抓几何映射切换到学习接触控制器。

12
00:01:02,044 --> 00:01:06,464
Neither the object-pose input nor this human switching should disappear from the explanation.
物体位姿输入和人工切换都不能从解释中省略。

13
00:01:07,245 --> 00:01:12,105
Training uses one hundred fifty twenty-second reference clips for each object.
每个物体使用150段、每段20秒参考。

14
00:01:12,545 --> 00:01:18,145
Controllers also require extensive simulated interaction and task-specific object information.
控制器还需要大量仿真交互与物体信息。

15
00:01:18,585 --> 00:01:24,065
Supporting two robot hands demonstrates adaptation of the workflow, not universal shared weights.
支持两种手证明流程可适配，不是通用同一权重。

16
00:01:24,629 --> 00:01:30,729
Across seven SharpaWave tasks, complete success averages seventy-five point two percent.
七项SharpaWave任务完整成功率平均75.2%。

17
00:01:31,349 --> 00:01:36,849
Task progress averages eighty-seven point one percent because partial completion also receives credit.
阶段进度平均87.1%，因为部分完成也计分。

18
00:01:37,249 --> 00:01:41,409
Each method receives fifteen trials per task under the same reported protocol.
每个方法按同协议，每任务测试15次。

19
00:01:42,095 --> 00:01:48,235
A separate diffusion policy is trained from newly collected demonstrations for three autonomous tasks.
另采示教训练扩散策略，测试三项自主任务。

20
00:01:48,495 --> 00:01:53,055
Those results must not be merged with the stronger human-in-the-loop teleoperation score.
这些结果不能混入更高的人在环遥操分数。

21
00:01:53,395 --> 00:01:57,575
New objects still require dedicated references and additional controller training.
新物体仍需专门参考和额外控制器训练。

22
00:01:58,160 --> 00:02:03,900
TeleDexter makes contact dynamics part of the mapping from human intention to robot action.
TeleDexter把接触动力学纳入人意图到机器人动作的映射。

23
00:02:04,420 --> 00:02:08,860
Its gain comes with external tracking and substantial object-specific preparation.
收益伴随外部跟踪和大量物体专用准备。

24
00:02:09,480 --> 00:02:14,580
Choose it for controlled contact-rich teleoperation, without assuming cheap markerless deployment.
它适合受控接触遥操，不能假定低成本无标记部署。
